          "text_quote": "Leveranse av data skal skje på et tidlig tidspunkt og i god tid før vegåpning.",
          "url": "https://www.vegvesen.no/fag/teknologi/nasjonal-vegdatabank/registrere-data-i-nvdb/dataleveranse/",
          "object_id": null,
          "correspondence": "retrieved_external",
          "verification_note": "Page fetched. It states that new projects should be registered at the start of the design phase and at the latest at construction start. It does not discuss opening dates or vegstatus, and the field definition for the start date of a road link was not retrieved."
        }
      ],
      "claim_evidence_links": [
        {
          "claim_text": "NVDB does not record when a road opens to traffic, only when its geometry was registered.",
          "source_object_ids": [
            "M1",
