      "numeric_check": null,
      "suggested_fix": "State which NVDB field is meant by 'geometry registered'. Cite Statens vegvesen's registration rules, which require registration early (design phase to construction start). Qualify the abstract, Section 4.3 and conclusion so the NVDB limitation is shown for one record. Treat the systematic comparison of registration dates with article dates (Section 8) as the test of how much the articles add."
