      "category": "event_timing_problem",
      "finding_summary": "Table 2 lists Grettefoss Bridge's status as 'Planned' although its own footnote c says it was confirmed to have opened on 3 November, before the paper's 9 November date. The status column is therefore stale or inconsistent with the footnote.",
